        <li>you acknowledge that submitting an enquiry does not oblige ALYRA to proceed, and does not oblige you to proceed.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="legal-p legal-p--em">Providing information about an asset for an enquiry or confidential valuation does not authorise ALYRA to publicly advertise, list, market or sell that asset.</p>
      <p class="legal-p">Information you provide through the Website is handled in accordance with our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2">7. Eligibility</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">To make an enquiry or transact with ALYRA you must:</p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>be at least 18 years of age;</li>
        <li>have legal capacity to enter into a binding agreement;</li>
        <li>own the relevant asset, or be authorised by its owner to deal with it; and</li>
        <li>be able to satisfy our identity, address and ownership verification requirements, including any requirements imposed by law.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="legal-p">ALYRA's services are directed at clients in Australia. We may be unable to assist if you or the asset are located outside Australia.</p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2">8. Accuracy and currency of information</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">We take reasonable care to ensure that information on the Website is accurate and current at the time of publication. However, we do not warrant that the Website is complete, accurate, current or free from error.</p>
      <p class="legal-p">Information about loan parameters, asset classes, processes, timeframes, custody arrangements and insurance may change without notice. Where the Website describes what ALYRA “may” or “typically” does, this describes a general practice and is not a promise in relation to any particular enquiry.</p>
      <p class="legal-p">Insurance may apply while assets are in custody, subject to policy terms, asset approval, valuation limits and custody conditions. Details will be confirmed in your written agreement.</p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2">9. Intellectual property</h2>
