      <p class="legal-p">Nothing on the Website grants you any licence or right to use any ALYRA trade mark or branding.</p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2">10. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">You must not, and must not attempt to:</p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>use the Website for any unlawful, fraudulent or misleading purpose;</li>
        <li>submit an enquiry about an asset you do not own or are not authorised to deal with;</li>
        <li>provide false identity, ownership or asset information;</li>
        <li>interfere with the security, integrity or availability of the Website or its underlying systems;</li>
        <li>introduce viruses, malicious code or harmful material;</li>
        <li>use automated tools to access, scrape or index the Website other than search engines operating in accordance with our robots directives; or</li>
        <li>impersonate ALYRA, its staff or another person.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="legal-p">We may restrict, suspend or terminate your access to the Website, and decline to deal with you, if we reasonably believe you have breached these Terms.</p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2">11. Security and genuine ALYRA communications</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">Because ALYRA deals with valuable assets, clients may be targeted by people impersonating us. Please take care to confirm you are dealing with ALYRA.</p>
      <p class="legal-p">ALYRA will never:</p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>ask you for a password or online banking login;</li>
        <li>ask you to transfer money to a personal or overseas account; or</li>
        <li>ask you to hand an asset to a courier or individual who has not been identified to you in writing by ALYRA in advance.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="legal-p">Our genuine email addresses end in <strong>@alyra.com.au</strong>. If you receive a communication that claims to be from ALYRA and you are unsure, do not act on it — contact us directly through the details on our <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page.</p>
      <p class="legal-p">Email and other electronic communications are not always secure. Please avoid sending sensitive documents until we have confirmed the appropriate channel with you.</p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2">12. Third-party websites and services</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">The Website may contain links to websites or services operated by third parties. Those links are provided for convenience only.</p>
