      <h2 class="legal-h2">14. Liability</h2>
      <p class="legal-p legal-p--em">Nothing in these Terms excludes, restricts or modifies any consumer guarantee, right or remedy that you have under the Australian Consumer Law or any other law that cannot lawfully be excluded, restricted or modified.</p>
