        <li>any third-party website, service or content; or</li>
        <li>any unauthorised access to, or interference with, the Website or your communications with us.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="legal-p">Where liability cannot be excluded but can be limited, ALYRA's liability is limited, at ALYRA's option, to resupplying the relevant service or paying the cost of having it resupplied.</p>
      <p class="legal-p">This section does not limit the terms of any written loan or other agreement between you and ALYRA, which contain their own provisions about liability.</p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2">15. Your responsibility</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">You are responsible for any loss ALYRA suffers as a result of your breach of these Terms, your provision of false or misleading information, or your unlawful use of the Website, to the extent that the loss was caused by you.</p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2">16. Privacy</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">Our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> explains how we collect, hold, use and disclose personal information, including information provided through the Website, and how you can access or correct it or make a privacy complaint.</p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2">17. Changes to these Terms</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">We may update these Terms from time to time. The current version will be published on the Website and identified by its effective or last-updated date. Your continued use of the Website after a change takes effect constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.</p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2">18. General</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">If any part of these Terms is found to be invalid or unenforceable, that part is severed and the remainder continues in effect. A failure by ALYRA to enforce any part of these Terms is not a waiver of that part.</p>
